WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.900
- I started acting when
I was 10 years old,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.656
I booked a little show called "Castle",

00:00:05.656 --> 00:00:07.154
I heard that you're a fan.

00:00:07.154 --> 00:00:09.518
- I'm a huge fan and I
actually remember this.

00:00:09.518 --> 00:00:11.338
- [Marcus] Oh they have a picture!

00:00:11.338 --> 00:00:12.833
No!
- [Kelly] I know!

00:00:12.833 --> 00:00:14.630
- Oh god.
- It was such a great show!

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:17.050
- Yeah, it was so good
but my characters name,

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.140
I had a one episode gust star role,

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:20.980
biggest, I was so proud of it.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:23.110
I ran in, one of the
characters I was like,

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:25.320
I ran up to him, my name
was Timmy in the show.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.477
Of course, a little kid
named Timmy, shocker.

00:00:27.477 --> 00:00:29.215
- (laughs) He's in the well.

00:00:29.215 --> 00:00:30.220
- Timmy's in the well!

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:31.847
But I ran up to him and I was like

00:00:31.847 --> 00:00:34.977
"Uncle Havi, you want to
see my baseball cards?"

00:00:36.108 --> 00:00:37.010
- [Kelly] And that was your moment.

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:38.428
- That was my big moment.

00:00:38.428 --> 00:00:40.155
So that was the break, that was it.

00:00:40.155 --> 00:00:43.470
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:46.902
- First of all, you are
hilarious, you are so fun.

00:00:46.902 --> 00:00:47.735
- [Marcus] Thank you.

00:00:47.735 --> 00:00:50.150
- I mean, God you're like a walking party.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.830
So you're on "Blackish",

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:55.230
so who's the most surprising
fan that you've met?

00:00:55.230 --> 00:00:57.193
- The most surprising fan I've met,

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.330
okay so let me start by saying this.

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:02.410
We got to go to the White House

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:04.930
for the Easter Egg Roll
a couple years back,

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:06.570
I know you guys can see
where this is going.

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:07.403
- [Kelly] That's amazing.

00:01:07.403 --> 00:01:10.020
- Gets pretty good from
here, but we got to go

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:11.690
to the White House for
the Easter egg roll,

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:13.340
I got to bring my entire family,

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:15.998
went to the Oval Office bathroom.

00:01:15.998 --> 00:01:19.140
Their paper towels are
literally like real towels.

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:21.700
- I love that you went to the bathroom.

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:23.310
- No the bathroom was the coolest part,

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:25.520
it was like marble all over the place,

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:27.158
I was like "Whoa, this-"

00:01:27.158 --> 00:01:29.327
- Most people are like
fascinated by the office.

00:01:29.327 --> 00:01:32.290
- No but the bathroom was tight.

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:33.978
You spend a lot of time in the bathroom.

00:01:33.978 --> 00:01:34.820
(audience applauds)

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:38.810
But we got to meet
Michelle and Barack Obama,

00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:40.838
it was an amazing experience,
yeah, there it is.

00:01:40.838 --> 00:01:43.290
(audience cheers)

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:44.590
If you pay close attention

00:01:44.590 --> 00:01:47.010
you can see my arm isn't around Michelle

00:01:47.010 --> 00:01:48.477
because I was like "Is this illegal?

00:01:48.477 --> 00:01:50.727
"Am I allowed to put my
arm around Michelle Obama?

00:01:50.727 --> 00:01:53.827
"Like is Secret Service just
gonna jump out of the roof

00:01:53.827 --> 00:01:55.820
"and like "Put your hands up.""

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:57.700
- I think you chose wisely,
I would've been nervous too.

00:01:57.700 --> 00:01:59.290
- So it's just awkwardly standing,

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:01.623
14 year old Marcus just
like (imitates groaning) so.

